 the troubling national divide

00:02:07.919 --> 00:02:11.756
that is eroding our humanity,
 and also a roadmap on

00:02:11.756 --> 00:02:15.510
how to best repair the broken spokes
 of our democratic system.

00:02:16.094 --> 00:02:19.347
It also serves to announce the creation
 of a brand new third party

00:02:19.347 --> 00:02:23.518
that Andrew has founded the forward party,
 which is part of Andrew's plan

00:02:23.518 --> 00:02:29.482
to help redress democratic dysfunction
 by disrupting America's two party duopoly.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:32.485
I got to say that I find Andrew's

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:35.363
creative approach
 to politics really energizing.

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:38.074
His ideas are fresh. They're bold.

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:41.244
I appreciate his genuineness, his candor,

00:02:41.244 --> 00:02:45.498
his humanness, his willingness and ability
 to not just think

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:49.252
outside the box,
 but actually to take action on new ideas.

00:02:49.294 --> 00:02:51.254
And I was very excited to talk to him. 

00:02:51.254 --> 00:02:52.922
So this is it. 

00:02:52.922 --> 00:02:57.468
Me and Andrew Yang having a semi wonky
 but not too wonky,

00:02:57.844 --> 00:03:02.223
relatively Partizan free conversation
 about how to best re-imagine

00:03:02.223 --> 00:03:05.476
the democratic experiment
 for the betterment of all.

00:03:06.936 --> 00:03:07.896
Super nice to meet you. 

00:03:07.896 --> 00:03:10.315
Thank you for coming out here to do
 this. It's great to be here.

00:03:10.481 --> 00:03:11.274
Thanks for having me. 

00:03:11.274 --> 00:03:11.691
Yeah, man. 

00:03:11.691 --> 00:03:14.944
So, so many things to talk about with you.

00:03:14.944 --> 00:03:18.448
I followed your journey and your
 trajectory has been super fascinating.

00:03:18.823 --> 00:03:21.784
And I think, like many, I find myself

00:03:21.951 --> 00:03:26.748
despairing about our country's division,
 and that's a divide

